                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "5cda960285408d7f8b0c75f3fbfc494d3afa83b44cb61b818719e00adaca9076",
                    "text": "苏璃抱着两本厚得能砸晕人的魔法教材，站在卖面饼的摊子旁。"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 1,
                    "chapter_sequence": 1,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 36,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "5cda960285408d7f8b0c75f3fbfc494d3afa83b44cb61b818719e00adaca9076",
                    "text": "苏璃很快察觉到我的异样，把书放到旁边的木箱上，伸手抓住我的手腕。"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 1,
                    "chapter_sequence": 1,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 36,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "5cda960285408d7f8b0c75f3fbfc494d3afa83b44cb61b818719e00adaca9076",
                    "text": "”\n\n苏璃睁开眼：“为什么？"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 2,
                    "chapter_sequence": 2,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 62,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "7d98c9d7f3b851ced3d6e680a6e7eb29d8693c706fdccdf07116264a19886850",
                    "text": "”\n\n苏璃的声音从门口传来。"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 2,
                    "chapter_sequence": 2,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 62,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "7d98c9d7f3b851ced3d6e680a6e7eb29d8693c706fdccdf07116264a19886850",
                    "text": "”\n\n苏璃走到床边，放下记录板。"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 2,
                    "chapter_sequence": 2,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 62,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "7d98c9d7f3b851ced3d6e680a6e7eb29d8693c706fdccdf07116264a19886850",
                    "text": "苏璃皱着眉扶住我的手臂，却没有阻止。"
                },
                {
                    "chapter_id": 3,
                    "chapter_sequence": 3,
                    "canonical_artifact_id": 84,
                    "canonical_artifact_checksum": "f4040ae768320dfc22f657c0d2987d40f7c4ae0cf9c3fd432954d38bc9cb279b",
